  "body": "* A Brilliant Way to Live * \r\nElevated, north-facing and beautifully positioned in St Heliers, 2 Brilliant is an exclusive collection of just seven generously proportioned apartments across three levels. Set on a prominent corner site, the development enjoys sweeping views across Churchill Park, St Heliers Bay and Rangitoto Island, with the Auckland cityscape beyond. Bathed in natural light, these elevated homes offer a spectacular outlook and a wonderful sense of space.\r\n\r\nApartment sizes range from 124m² to 305m², excluding decks, storage and car parking, offering a choice of beautifully considered homes to suit your next chapter. Four residences capture panoramic sea views, while all seven enjoy an elevated outlook.\r\n\r\n* Everything you love, right where you want to be * \r\n\r\nJust 600 metres from St Heliers Village and 700 metres from the beach, 2 Brilliant puts the best of the Bays within easy reach. Cafés, restaurants, local shops, medical facilities, parks and sporting clubs are all close by. Tamaki Drive, public transport and motorway connections make the wider city easily accessible. The beach is still your beach. The village is still your village. Your favourite places and familiar connections remain.\r\n\r\n* Beautifully considered. Effortlessly lived in * \r\n\r\nArchitecturally designed by Cottee Parker in collaboration with Nest Living, with interiors by Rachyl Abraham of Tesori Design, 2 Brilliant brings together timeless architecture, considered design and enduring quality.\r\nNatural stone, premium appliances and carefully selected finishes complement generous kitchens and living spaces designed for both relaxed everyday living and entertaining. The elevated, north-facing position maximises natural light, privacy and those exceptional views. Every apartment includes two car parks and walk-in storage, with low-maintenance living giving you more time to enjoy the things that matter.\r\n\r\n* Exclusively yours * \r\n\r\nBacked by an experienced local team and an established capital partnership, 2 Brilliant represents a considered commitment to quality, integrity and excellence. Just seven residences. An exceptional St Heliers position. A spectacular outlook.\r\n\r\n* No change to the lifestyle you love. Just a Brilliant Way to Live * \r\n\r\nThe exclusive residences at 2 Brilliant are priced from $2,795,000. Be bold. Be Brilliant. Be first! \r\nCall Ross, Holly & Cheryl to arrange your private appointment or request further information.\r\n\r\nRSVP link to attend our launch event Weds 18th November 5.30pm: https://forms.gle/nPe647LJ1H53yCmC9\r\n\r\nWebsite: https://2brilliant.nz/\r\nBody Corp Levies - to be set\r\nCV's - to be set\r\nNew Titles - to issue",
